OL,3,ANavi Pillay, former UN human rights
OL,4,Achief, wins Nobel Peace Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer early work included defending
OL,7,Fanti-apartheid activists in South
OL,8,FAfrica, and on Friday she became the
OL,9,Fcountry's fifth Peace Prize winner -
OL,10,Ffollowing in the footsteps of Nelson
OL,11,FMandela and Archbishop Desmond Tutu.
